title The weaver and the weave
prompt Keaton: how would we reimplement that editor in TAME style Glow, Rishi and Rye for Caravan, with Comlink-tendency module names? Call it Kabir after the poet, command kab. External research then silo technique to active-designing; I choose high priority or yonder. Do not mention the editor's short command in the writings.
rota none -- a commissioned design pair rather than a rota row; the Aether row was read at 20260908.011935.
think Two pages by law: external-research studies the world WITH attribution, active-designing names only our own things. Writing them in that order is the silo technique rather than a preference, so I read the editor's own published design document before writing a word of ours.
think The name came back richer than a free slot. Kabir is ALREADY in this tree -- the Inner Scope charter names him among its inspirations beside Rumi, Hafez and Ibn Arabi. So the choice continues something rather than starting it, and `kab` is free across the whole tree.
obs THE RESONANCE IS NOT DECORATION, IT IS THE ARGUMENT. Kabir was a WEAVER, and Mantra was named for the weave. An editor named for a weaver sitting over a projection named for the weave is one image carried twice rather than two images competing -- which is exactly what the Comlink tendency asks a name to do.
obs THE ONE TRANSFERABLE IDEA IS ABOUT ORDER, NOT ABOUT KEYS. Show the object before the verb acts on it. That is a claim about when a person can see what is about to happen, and this tree already argues it in a room with no cursor in it: a scan prints the repair it computed and the tool applies exactly that column. The editor would be that habit given a cursor.
obs CARAVAN IS WHY THE IDEA IS INTERESTING RATHER THAN ORDINARY. An editor is usually a program that opens files; over Caravan it is a supervised session whose reach can be conferred and revoked WHILE IT RUNS -- an attachment that may read a buffer and not the disk. No editor in the world says that sentence today, and we already have the mechanism.
obs I CHOSE YONDER AND THE REASON IS ARITHMETIC RATHER THAN TASTE. The card stands at 40,942 of its 40,960 ceiling with three bookings already reduced to one-line pointers; a fourth would displace a fold nobody has earned. And the finishing edge asks one real thing to ship before the next is named -- the live card already holds an operator manual, a molt grant and a table-store lap, none finished.
obs SO THE PAGE ARGUES FOR A NAME AND A SHAPE AND AGAINST A BUILD, AND SAYS WHAT WOULD CHANGE THAT. If Glow grows a rune surface wanting an editor to exercise it, or Caravan's confer-and-revoke wants a first resident that is not a test, Kabir becomes the obvious place to prove both. Written down so the decision is checkable rather than permanent.
obs THE HONEST COST IS STATED BEFORE THE ENTHUSIASM, NOT AFTER. Buffer representation, undo, incremental redisplay, terminal capabilities, input decoding and encoding are each real bodies of work and none is the interesting part. The grammar is perhaps a tenth of an editor. A design page that opens with that number is harder to misread than one that closes with it.
